abstract: >-
  A five-day consumer-side study of a self-evolving agent framework
  distributed inside a desktop AI product installer: static anatomy,
  live-lab observation, and runtime audit with independent recomputation.
  Evidence is graded E1–E4. No third-party source code is redistributed.
